SUMMARY:PCIM Europe 2027: Abstract submission (23:59 UTC+12 (assumed))
DESCRIPTION:International Exhibition and Conference for Power Electronics\,
  Intelligent Motion\, Renewable Energy and Energy Management (PCIM Europe 
 2027)\n\nAbstract submission: 14 Oct 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nConf
 erence: May 11-13\, 2027\nLocation: Nuremberg\, Germany\nVenue: Nuremberg 
 Exhibition Centre\n\nAll dates:\n  Abstract submission: 14 Oct 2026\, 23:5
 9 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Full manuscript submission: 9 Mar 2027\, 23:59 UTC+1
 2 (assumed)\n\nNot yet announced: Acceptance notification and speaker regi
 stration\n\nThe call for papers states no timezone. This is counted as UTC
 +12\, the earliest it could plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs out bef
 ore the real deadline rather than after it.\n\nThe same 14 October 2026 de
 adline covers synopses for the seminars held on 9-10 May 2027 at the Arven
 a Park Hotel\, whose documentation is due 14 April 2027. Acceptance is exp
 ected in January 2027 without a stated date.\n\nCall for papers: https://p
 cim.mesago.com/nuernberg/en.html\nDetails: https://langestefan.github.io/p
 owersystem-deadlines/conference/pcim-europe27
LOCATION:Nuremberg\, Germany
URL;VALUE=URI:https://pcim.mesago.com/nuernberg/en.html
CATEGORIES:Power Electronics,Machines & Drives,Renewables,Energy Storage
